OpenSoundboard bundles Electron, React, Zustand, Lucide, clsx and ws. Their
copyright notices and licence texts are reproduced in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`,
which ships with the application.

Electron in turn redistributes Chromium and FFmpeg under their own licences
(BSD-3-Clause, LGPL-2.1 and others). Those notices ship in the packaged
application as `LICENSE.electron.txt` and `LICENSES.chromium.html`.

OpenSoundboard does not redistribute VB-CABLE. The driver is downloaded from
VB-Audio's own servers at the user's request, and remains subject to VB-Audio's
licence terms: https://vb-audio.com/Cable/
